# Quran Reel Generator — repository and release hygiene
#
# RELEASE_AUDIT Phase 0/1, finalised 2026-11-23.
# DENY BY DEFAULT for anything user-supplied, rights-unverified, generated or
# machine-local. `git add .` must never publish media, drafts, reels, backups,
# caches or private notes. Only source code, small text data and documentation
# are committable. The matching `git archive` exclusions are in .gitattributes.

# --- Python environments and caches -------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- OS / editor noise ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Backups and private artefacts (local only, never published) ---------
.backups/
.backup-before-audio-player/
*.backup
*.bak

# Private handoff / internal dev reports & legacy Chrome test scripts.
HANDOFF.md
LATEST_HANDOFF.md
PHASE1_REPORT.md
FINAL_TEST_HANDOFF.md
REACT_UI_MIGRATION_FINAL_REPORT.md
RELEASE_AUDIT.md
TEN_RECITERS_DATASET_RESEARCH_REPORT.md
Review/
docs/superpowers/
tests/*.mjs

# --- Caches, logs, browser/test scratch ----------------------------------
.qvs_cache/
tests/.chrome-profile/
tests/.sandbox/
tests/.sandbox.pid
tests/logs/
tests/sandbox-server.log
tests/draft-baseline/
tests/screenshots/
logs/
*.log

# --- Generated application state (user data, not code) -------------------
Draft/
Output/

# --- User-supplied / rights-unverified media ------------------------------
# ALL of Assets/ is excluded by default: recitation audio, backgrounds,
# Quran text/timing datasets, fonts and icons. The only exception is the
# small provenance record below, which is documentation, not media.
Assets/**
!Assets/licences/
!Assets/licences/SOURCES.txt

# Explicit reminders of what the rule above covers (also catches files that
# might be force-added from elsewhere in the tree):
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.wav
*.m4a
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2

# --- Starter bundle assets (required to run & build standalone releases) --
# Full 16 GB audio library and 1.1 GB personal videos remain excluded above;
# only the lightweight core Quran data, font, icons, 3 starter samples, and
# starter Surah Al-Fatihah (001.mp3) are tracked.
!Assets/AppIcon.ico
!Assets/AppIcon.icns
!Assets/Banner.png
!Assets/fonts/
!Assets/fonts/UthmanicHafs1Ver18.ttf
!Assets/Quran Text/
!Assets/Quran Text/**
!Assets/Quran Timing/
!Assets/Quran Timing/**
!Assets/Background Templates/
!Assets/Background Templates/Videos/
!Assets/Background Templates/Videos/Sample1.mp4
!Assets/Background Templates/Videos/Sample2.mp4
!Assets/Background Templates/Videos/Sample3.mp4
!Assets/audio/
!Assets/audio/*/
!Assets/audio/*/001.mp3

# --- Standalone build outputs --------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
build_win/
dist_win/
*.spec
*.dmg
*.app/
Quran-Reel-Generator-Windows.zip

# --- Node / React frontend & Mobile PWA build caches ---------------------
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.vite/
mobile-pwa/node_modules/
mobile-pwa/dist/
mobile-pwa/.vite/
mobile-pwa/public/data/
mobile-pwa/public/assets/
!mobile-pwa/samples/
!mobile-pwa/samples/*.mp4
!mobile-pwa/samples/*.jpg

# NOTE: `Review/` is intentionally committable — it is the per-phase review
# deliverable. `FINAL_TEST_HANDOFF.md` is the release-test handover document.
